 class="t s3_50" data-oc="true">3</span><span id="t8_50" class="t s3_50" data-oc="true">4</span><span id="t9_50" class="t s3_50" data-oc="true">Next Â» </span><span id="ta_50" class="t s4_50" data-oc="true">"The man who never makes a mistake always takes orders from one who does." </span><span id="tb_50" class="t s4_50" data-oc="true">Daisy Bates </span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="page-container" class="page-container tw-relative" data-page="51"><div class="CYtV78FustZrAng5u4BPfw=="><div data-html-viewer-page="51" style="transform:scale(calc( var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640));transform-origin:top left"><div data-testid="html-preview-wrapper" style="height:calc(829px * var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640)"><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;data-height&quot;:&quot;829&quot;,&quot;data-width&quot;:&quot;640&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;html-prev-51&quot;}}" data-props="{&quot;dataHeight&quot;:&quot;829&quot;}"><div><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;html-preview-text&quot;}}" data-props="{&quot;className&quot;:&quot;html-preview-text&quot;,&quot;testId&quot;:&quot;html-preview-text&quot;}"><div class="html-preview-text" data-testid="html-preview-text"><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;ch-page-slice lazyload&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;width: 640px; height: 829px; position: relative; background-position: 0 0; background-image: &quot;,&quot;data-bg&quot;:&quot;/api/v1/documents/unlocked/13635412/bg/5a53d4d730d4971f7989cddbaade3027/51.jpg&quot;}}" data-props="{&quot;className&quot;:&quot;ch-page-slice lazyload&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;640px&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;829px&quot;,&quot;position&quot;:&quot;relative&quot;,&quot;backgroundPosition&quot;:&