s="t s6_51" data-oc="true">Â« Previous</span><span id="ti_51" class="t s6_51" data-oc="true">1</span><span id="tj_51" class="t s5_51" data-oc="true">2</span><span id="tk_51" class="t s7_51" data-oc="true">3</span><span id="tl_51" class="t s7_51" data-oc="true">4</span><span id="tm_51" class="t s7_51" data-oc="true">Next Â» </span><span id="tn_51" class="t s8_51" data-oc="true">"There is no substitute for hard work." </span><span id="to_51" class="t s8_51" data-oc="true">Thomas Edison </span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="page-container" class="page-container tw-relative" data-page="52"><div class="CYtV78FustZrAng5u4BPfw=="><div data-html-viewer-page="52" style="transform:scale(calc( var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640));transform-origin:top left"><div data-testid="html-preview-wrapper" style="height:calc(829px * var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640)"><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;data-height&quot;:&quot;829&quot;,&quot;data-width&quot;:&quot;640&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;html-prev-52&quot;}}" data-props="{&quot;dataHeight&quot;:&quot;829&quot;}"><div><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;html-preview-text&quot;}}" data-props="{&quot;className&quot;:&quot;html-preview-text&quot;,&quot;testId&quot;:&quot;html-preview-text&quot;}"><div class="html-preview-text" data-testid="html-preview-text"><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;ch-page-slice lazyload&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;width: 640px; height: 829px; position: relative; background-position: 0 0; background-image: &quot;,&quot;data-bg&quot;:&quot;/api/v1/documents/unlocked/13635412/bg/f74ac8b306930bb7cb2c56af74fadf89/52.jpg&quot;}}" data-props="{&quot;className&quot;:&quot;ch-page-slice lazyload&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;w