"true">profit taking levels</span><span id="tj_62" class="t s5_62" data-oc="true">. Again, since so </span><span id="tk_62" class="t s5_62" data-oc="true">many traders are watching these levels and placing buy and sell orders to take </span><span id="tl_62" class="t s5_62" data-oc="true">profits, this tool usually works due self-fulfilling expectations. </span><span id="tm_62" class="t s5_62" data-oc="true">In order to apply Fibonacci levels to your charts, you'll need to identify Swing High </span><span id="tn_62" class="t s5_62" data-oc="true">and Swing Low points. </span><span id="to_62" class="t s5_62" data-oc="true">A Swing High is a candlestick with at least two lower highs on both the left and </span><span id="tp_62" class="t s5_62" data-oc="true">right of itself. </span><span id="tq_62" class="t s5_62" data-oc="true">A Swing Low is a candlestick with at least two higher lows on both the left and right </span><span id="tr_62" class="t s5_62" data-oc="true">of itself. </span><span id="ts_62" class="t s7_62" data-oc="true">Â« Previous</span><span id="tt_62" class="t s7_62" data-oc="true">1</span><span id="tu_62" class="t s7_62" data-oc="true">2</span><span id="tv_62" class="t s7_62" data-oc="true">3</span><span id="tw_62" class="t s5_62" data-oc="true">4Next Â» </span><span id="tx_62" class="t s8_62" data-oc="true">"If you are going to achieve excellence in big things, you develop the habit in little matters. Excellence is not an exception, it is a prevailing attitude." </span><span id="ty_62" class="t s8_62" data-oc="true">Colin Powell </span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="page-container" class="page-container tw-relative" data-page="63"><div class="CYtV78FustZrAng5u4BPfw=="><div data-html-viewer-page="63" style="transform:scale(calc( var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640));transform-origin:top left"><div data-testid="html-preview-wrapper" style="height:calc(829px * var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640)"><div data-block=