m_88" class="t s6_88" data-oc="true">Ascending Triangles </span><span id="tn_88" class="t s6_88" data-oc="true">Descending Triangles </span><span id="to_88" class="t s6_88" data-oc="true">Double Top </span><span id="tp_88" class="t s6_88" data-oc="true">Double Bottom </span><span id="tq_88" class="t s6_88" data-oc="true">Head and Shoulders </span><span id="tr_88" class="t s6_88" data-oc="true">Reverse Head and Shoulders </span><span id="ts_88" class="t s5_88" data-oc="true">Â« Previous1</span><span id="tt_88" class="t s7_88" data-oc="true">2</span><span id="tu_88" class="t s7_88" data-oc="true">3</span><span id="tv_88" class="t s7_88" data-oc="true">4</span><span id="tw_88" class="t s7_88" data-oc="true">5</span><span id="tx_88" class="t s7_88" data-oc="true">6</span><span id="ty_88" class="t s7_88" data-oc="true">7</span><span id="tz_88" class="t s7_88" data-oc="true">8</span><span id="t10_88" class="t s7_88" data-oc="true">9</span><span id="t11_88" class="t s7_88" data-oc="true">Next Â» </span><span id="t12_88" class="t s8_88" data-oc="true">"Things may come to those who wait, but only the things left by those who hustle." </span><span id="t13_88" class="t s8_88" data-oc="true">Abraham Lincoln </span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="page-container" class="page-container tw-relative" data-page="89"><div class="CYtV78FustZrAng5u4BPfw=="><div data-html-viewer-page="89" style="transform:scale(calc( var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640));transform-origin:top left"><div data-testid="html-preview-wrapper" style="height:calc(829px * var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640)"><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;data-height&quot;:&quot;829&quot;,&quot;data-width&quot;:&quot;640&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;html-prev-89&quot;}}" data-props="{&quot;dataHeight&quot;:&quot;829&quot;}"><div><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;html-preview-text&quot;}}" data-props="{&quot;className&quot;:&quot;html-preview-text&quot;,&quot;testId&quot;:&quot;html-preview-text&quot;}"><div class="html-preview-text" data-testid="html-preview-text"><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;ch-page-slice lazyload&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;width: 640px; height: 829px; position: relative; background-position: 0 0; background-image: &quot;,&quot;data-bg&quot;:&quot;/api/v1/documents/unlocked/13635412/bg/24a5cb85d9f696cd56a277c6d67df7e8/89.jpg&quot;}}" data-props="{&quot;className&quot;:&quot;ch-page-slice lazyload&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;640px&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;829px&quot;,&quot;position&quot;:&quot;relative&quot;,&quot;backgroundPosition&quot;:&quot;0 0&quot;},&quot;data-bg&quot;:&quot;/api/v1/documents/unlocked/13635412/bg/24a5cb85d9f696cd56a277c6d67df7e8/89.jpg&quot;,&quot;altHeight&quot;:null}"><div data-testid="ch-page-slice" class="ch-page-slice" data-page="89" style="width:630px;height:829px;position:relative;background-position:0 0;overflow:hidden"><span id="t1_89" class="t s1_89" data-oc="true">Symmetrical Triangles - 7th Grade: Important Chart Patterns - Beginner'...</span><span id="t2_89" class="t s1_89" data-oc="true">http://www.babypips.com/school/symmetrical_triangles.html </span><span id="t3_89" class="t s1_89" data-oc="true">1 of 1</span><span id="t4_89" class="t s1_89" data-oc="true">11/13/2007 4:08 PM</span><span id="t5_89" class="t s2_89" data-oc="true">Symmetrical Triangles </span><span id="t6_89" class="t s3_89" data-oc="true">Print and run! Prefer to print out these lessons? </span><span id="t7_89" class="t s4_89" data-oc="true">Buy the PDF</span><span id="t8_89" class="t s3_89" data-oc="true">. Only $49. </span><span id="t9_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">Symmetrical triangles are chart formations where the slope of the price's highs and </span><span id="ta_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">the slope of the price's lows converge together to a point where it looks like a </span><span id="tb_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">triangle. What is happening during this formation is that the market is making </span><span id="tc_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">lower highs and higher lows. </span><span id="td_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">This means that neither the buyers nor the sellers are </span><span id="te_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">pushing the price far enough to make a clear trend. </span><span id="tf_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">If this was a battle between </span><span id="tg_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">the buyers and sellers, then this would be a draw. </span><span id="th_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">This type of activity is called consolidation. </span><span id="ti_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">In the chart above, we can see that neither the buyers nor the sellers could push </span><span id="tj_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">the price in their direction. When this happens we get lower highs and higher lows. </span><span id="tk_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">As these two slopes get closer to each other, it means that a breakout is getting </span><span id="tl_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">near. We don't know what direction the breakout will be, but we do know that the </span><span id="tm_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">market </span><span id="tn_89" class="t s6_89" data-oc="true">will</span><span id="to_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">break out. Eventually, one side of the market will give in. </span><span id="tp_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">So how can we take advantage of this? Simple. We can place entry orders above </span><span id="tq_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">the slope of the lower highs and below the slope of the higher lows. </span><span id="tr_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">Since we </span><span id="ts_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">already know that the price is going to break out, we can just hitch a ride in </span><span id="tt_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">whatever direction the market moves. </span><span id="tu_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">In this example, if we placed an entry order above the slope of the lower highs, we </span><span id="tv_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">would've been taken along for a nice ride up. If you had placed another entry order </span><span id="tw_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">below the slope of the higher lows, then you would cancel it as soon as the first </span><span id="tx_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">order was hit. </span><span id="ty_89" class="t s7_89" data-oc="true">Â« Previous</span><span id="tz_89" class="t s7_89" data-oc="true">1</span><span id="t10_89" class="t s5_89" data-oc="true">2</span><span id="t11_89" class="t s8_89" data-oc="true">3</span><span id="t12_89" class="t s8_89" data-oc="true">4</span><span id="t13_89" class="t s8_89" data-oc="true">5</span><span id="t14_89" class="t s8_89" data-oc="true">6</span><span id="t15_89" class="t s8_89" data-oc="true">7</span><span id="t16_89" class="t s8_89" data-oc="true">8</span><span id="t17_89" class="t s8_89" data-oc="true">9</span><span id="t18_89" class="t s8_89" data-oc="true">Next Â» </span><span id="t19_89" class="t s9_89" data-oc="true">"It's choice - not chance - that determines your destiny." </span><span id="t1a_89" class="t s9_89" data-oc="true">Jean Nidetch </span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="page-container" class="page-container tw-relative" data-page="90"><div class="CYtV78FustZrAng5u4BPfw=="><div data-html-viewer-page="90" style="transform:scale(calc( var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640));transform-origin:top left"><div data-testid="html-preview-wrapper" style="height:calc(829px * var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640)"><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&