oc="true">Like I said earlier, trading is not like buying a t-shirt. One size does not fit all. </span><span id="td_158" class="t s5_158" data-oc="true">Before you can succeed in trading, you must spend time doing homework, learning </span><span id="te_158" class="t s5_158" data-oc="true">your personal strengths and weaknesses, and assessing your personal schedule, </span><span id="tf_158" class="t s5_158" data-oc="true">trading capital and trading experience. </span><span id="tg_158" class="t s5_158" data-oc="true">Take the time to answer these questions, and also look back at your trading journal </span><span id="th_158" class="t s5_158" data-oc="true">to see how you fared in different trading situations. Only then will you be able to </span><span id="ti_158" class="t s5_158" data-oc="true">decide on a trading personality that's compatible for you. </span><span id="tj_158" class="t s6_158" data-oc="true">Â« Previous</span><span id="tk_158" class="t s6_158" data-oc="true">1</span><span id="tl_158" class="t s6_158" data-oc="true">2</span><span id="tm_158" class="t s6_158" data-oc="true">3</span><span id="tn_158" class="t s5_158" data-oc="true">4Next Â» </span><span id="to_158" class="t s7_158" data-oc="true">"Good judgment comes from experience. Experience comes from bad judgment." </span><span id="tp_158" class="t s7_158" data-oc="true">Jim Horning </span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="page-container" class="page-container tw-relative" data-page="159"><div class="CYtV78FustZrAng5u4BPfw=="><div data-html-viewer-page="159" style="transform:scale(calc( var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640));transform-origin:top left"><div data-testid="html-preview-wrapper" style="height:calc(829px * var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640)"><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;data-height&quot;:&quot;829&quot;,&quot;data-width&quot;:&quot;640&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;html-prev-1