 id="ts_178" class="t s5_178" data-oc="true">from the interest rate differential of the two currencies, this pair has been a nice </span><span id="tt_178" class="t s5_178" data-oc="true">long term play for many investors and traders able to weather the volatile up and </span><span id="tu_178" class="t s5_178" data-oc="true">down movements of the currency market. </span><span id="tv_178" class="t s5_178" data-oc="true">Of course, economic and political factors are changing the world daily. </span><span id="tw_178" class="t s5_178" data-oc="true">The interest </span><span id="tx_178" class="t s5_178" data-oc="true">rates and interest rate differentials between currencies may change as well, </span><span id="ty_178" class="t s5_178" data-oc="true">bringing popular carry trades (such as the Yen carry trade) out of favor with </span><span id="tz_178" class="t s5_178" data-oc="true">investors. </span><span id="t10_178" class="t s6_178" data-oc="true">Â« Previous</span><span id="t11_178" class="t s6_178" data-oc="true">1</span><span id="t12_178" class="t s6_178" data-oc="true">2</span><span id="t13_178" class="t s6_178" data-oc="true">3</span><span id="t14_178" class="t s5_178" data-oc="true">4</span><span id="t15_178" class="t s7_178" data-oc="true">5</span><span id="t16_178" class="t s7_178" data-oc="true">Next Â» </span><span id="t17_178" class="t s8_178" data-oc="true">"You become what you think about." </span><span id="t18_178" class="t s8_178" data-oc="true">Earl Nightingale </span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="page-container" class="page-container tw-relative" data-page="179"><div class="CYtV78FustZrAng5u4BPfw=="><div data-html-viewer-page="179" style="transform:scale(calc( var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640));transform-origin:top left"><div data-testid="html-preview-wrapper" style="height:calc(829px * var(--initial-viewer-width) / 640)"><div data-block="true" data-originaltag="{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;div&quot;,&quot